window.products.push({"id":1044025,"name":"Worldexplorer Handmade Horn Wood Napkin Ring Set with 8 Napkin Rings - Artisan Crafted in India (Pack of 8)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QT+ppbuIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your dinner table simply can't look its best if your napkins are just placed haphazardly next to the plates. To set a beautiful table, you need to roll or fold your napkins neatly, and the World Explorer Handmade Horn Napkin Ring Set will help you keep them that way until it's time to eat! The World Explorer Handmade Horn Napkin Ring Set gives you a total of napkin rings that are sure to suit those with modern taste. Each napkin ring is a perfect smooth circle that measures in diameter to fit napkins of a variety of thicknesses and sizes. Crafted out of hardHorn, the napkin rings show off the handsome look of their natural materials with a dark finish that accentuates the Horn grain. The napkin rings coordinate with all colors and have a minimalistic chic style that is contemporary and fresh. Handcrafted by skilled Hornworkers in India, the World Explorer Handmade Horn Napkin Ring Set is truly of the absolute best quality. Only the finest Indian hardHorn are used to construct the napkin rings, and each one is made with traditional techniques to ensure that it is both beautiful and durable. These napkin rings can last for years to come and make an exceptional housewarming gift, host or hostess gift, wedding gift, bridal shower gift, birthday gift, Mother's Day gift or Christmas gift due to their unparalleled quality and versatile design. Keep your napkins rolled the stylish way with the best modern napkin rings on Amazon! Order the World Explorer Handmade Horn Napkin Ring Set now. Make this holiday season your Diwali Thanksgiving and Christmas party truly exceptional with vibrant table decorations items of World Explorer. Make this holiday season your Diwali Thanksgiving and Christmas party truly exceptional with vibrant table decorations items of World Explorer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QT+ppbuIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Worldexplorer","source_asin":"B07G9KHX3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G9KHX3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G9KHX3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
