window.products.push({"id":1044170,"name":"Memory Foam Pillow for Bed Sleeping Ergonomic Contour Design for Side & Back & Stomach Sleepers, Cervical Shape Pillow Gently Cradles Head & Provides ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bXlRD9TxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ERGONOMIC DESIGN FOR BACK & SIDE & STOMACH SLEEPERS: The contour pillow comes in two heights, 4.33/3.15in, and has been designed to suit different preferences. Five different areas with higher side bolsters provide optimal neck support for side sleeping. The head support area has a concave design that allows your head to sink in slowly while maintaining a healthy natural curve in your neck. This unique feature reduces pressure on your neck, making it ideal for back and stomach sleepers alike CLOUD-LIKE CUSHIONING WITH ZERO PRESSURE: This pillow for neck support made of cooling gel-infused Zero Pressure memory foam, which provides adequate support and wraps your head and neck. The memory foam particles in the center area provide a massage-like effect, helping to release tension and promote relaxation. The sweeping shoulder line and center contour allow for a seamless fit and relaxing back & stomach sleep SOFT, SMOOTH AND STRETCHY PILLOWCASE: Our cervical pillow's fabric has been certified by OEKO-TEX's STANDARD 100, meaning that it's free from harmful substances. The high-gram weight knit fabric is elastic and has been brushed to ensure that it's soft and gentle on your skin. Its smooth surface prevents skin irritation and wrinkles, making it a comfortable choice for a peaceful night's sleep MULTIPLE COLORS AND MACHINE WASHABLE: Our neck pillow comes in a variety of macaron colors, including white, light gray, dark gray, blue, and yellow, which can complement your home decor.The pillow has a hidden zipper that allows for easy removal and washing. The pillow structure includes a pillowcase, memory foam core, and lining WORRY-FREE WITH 100% SATISFACTION: Our excellent customer service ensures that any questions you have will be answered quickly and efficiently. If you're not satisfied with our product, we offer a worry-free 30-day return or exchange policy. Invest in your sleep with our A-Class Baby-Friendly Bed Pillow, and experience the comfort of high-quality sleep every night","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bXlRD9TxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OS OMYSTYLE","source_asin":"B0BVZJS3SV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVZJS3SV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVZJS3SV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
