window.products.push({"id":1044223,"name":"TILLYOU Cotton Bamboo Waffle Throw Blanket, Gray Throw Blankets for Couch, 60x80 inches, Soft Lightweight Waffle Weave Blanket for All Season","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yZruEgTAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Soft Material - 50% bamboo and 50% cotton. Our throw blanket is 100% safe and skin-friendly. Helps regulate temperature and wick away moisture so you can get to sleep easier than ever Waffle Weave Texture - Featuring an exquisite waffle pattern, and designed to enhance your room's decor. Its unique weaving technology provides more flexibility, giving you comfort and coziness Complete Waffle Bedding - Enjoy one of the greatest pleasures with our waffle weave blanket when relaxing, lounging, reading, or taking a nap. Available in Gray, White or Pink, our solid throw blanket is great match to your room bedding Versatile Blanket - This waffle blanket can be used as bedspread, quilt or duvet. It is also suitable for outdoor use like going picnic, travelling, backpacking or just when you nap in your office or carry it in cars Easy Care & Wash - Simply machine wash your 60\"x80\" throw size bed blanket in cold water on gentle cycle, then tumble low dry, or lay flat to air dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yZruEgTAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TILLYOU","source_asin":"B0995K5S11","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995K5S11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995K5S11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1044224,"name":"Johnson Brothers Old Britain Castles Pink Teapot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WX52MBV2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This historical and traditional pattern, old British castles, intricately rendered by a miss fennel back in 1928. She, the daughter of a master engraver, created these original drawings from old book photographs and steel engravings. OBC is certainly one of the best known patterns from Johnson Brothers and has been in production since 1930. Each piece of china depicting a scene of a different castle has extended to 45 castles. . The OBC pink teapot is a perfect way to service morning or afternoon tea. Durable for everyday use and can go in the dishwasher, freezer, and microwave. Holds 40-ounce. Features farnham and donnington castles. Amazon.com Cherished by collectors, Johnson Brothers' Old Britain Castles porcelain dinnerware depicts notable British buildings set in their 18th century landscapes, with each scene identified and dated. Ornamental floral borders harmonize the pieces. This teapot exemplifies high-style tea service. Standing on little feet, the teapot's sides curve in and out voluptuously, and a delicate handle sits atop the lid. The teapot holds 34 ounces, spans 9-3/4 inches from spout to handle, and stands 5-1/2 inches high. All Old Britain Castles pieces are made in England and are dishwasher- and microwave-safe. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WX52MBV2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Johnson Brothers","source_asin":"B000050992","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000050992","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000050992","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1044225,"name":"mDesign Wall Mount Metal Entryway Storage Organizer Mail Sorter Basket with 5 Hooks - Letter, Magazine, Coat, Leash and Key Holder for Entryway, Mudro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lZFYuy8zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE STORAGE: Keep mudrooms and entryways neat and tidy with this mail station; This durable steel wire organizer has one generously sized basket and multiple hooks; Great for holding and sorting in-going or out-going mail, organizing letters, bills, catalogs, magazines, keys, leashes, hats, umbrellas, accessories and more; The natural, organic vine design on this organizer will add some style to your storage and complement your home decor INSTANT ORGANIZATION: Drop off mail in the basket and hang your car keys, lanyards, purses, bags, pashminas and more on a hook; No more searching for often used accessories, now you have a place for them - hang your keys and use the basket to drop cell/mobile phones, smart tablets, cameras, wallets, wristlets, sunglasses, and reading glasses; The hooks have soft ends to ensure that clothing and scarves won't snag; Perfect for home, apartment, condos, dorm room, campers, RVs and cabins FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE: Create extra storage space wherever you need it and take advantage of unused wall space; Use wherever more storage is needed in hallways, entryways, mudrooms, kitchens, laundry/utility rooms, garages, offices and more; Easily mounts to the wall with the included hardware; Try mounting inside cabinet doors for more discreet storage; mDESIGN TIP - measure the depth of your cabinet doors and use mounting hardware of the correct length QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of strong steel wire with a steel wire mesh base; Has a durable finish; Easy Care - Clean with damp cloth THOUGHTFULLY SIZED: Measures 2.5\" x 10.5\" x 4.5\" high","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lZFYuy8zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B07ZWGD2GM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZWGD2GM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZWGD2GM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1044226,"name":"Prepara Chef's Center Cookbook Holder – Adjustable, rotates, Folds Flat, 12.25 x10, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Sq+jk3y1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Following recipe instructions in the kitchen is made simpler and easier with the Prepara Chef’s Center Cookbook Holder . Designed in the U.S.A., this innovative cookbook holder keeps your recipes in plain view. However, it isn’t exclusive to cookbooks – it can also hold small recipe text cards and tablets. For cookbooks, it will keep the page of your current recipe in place, so you won’t need to turn back every time you want to double-check your ingredient list. Also, this device has a clear, protective splashguard screen to safeguard your gadgets and the pages of your cookbooks from unexpected splashes and food residue. This will help keep your electronics and recipes in excellent condition. This book holder also folds flat for easy storage, making clean-up a breeze. You’ll be the star chef of your kitchen with the Prepara Chef’s Center Cookbook Holder! In addition, this device features a multi-adjustable support that aids in kitchen cooking tasks. The holder can be repositioned and propped at various angles, letting you cook paleo diet, bestseller, vegan, fixate, and instant pot recipes without worrying about your page placement. The stand’s spine brace can also be adjusted for books of various sizes, holding everything from a single recipe card to a cookbook as thick as an encyclopedia. It doesn’t matter – this cookbook stand can keep them all in place! The efficient features of this stand also include a Lazy Susan base that allows 360-degree rotation without moving the whole device. This is especially helpful for cooking, since the chef often needs to move rapidly between the stove, the counter, and the sink. A weights and measurements conversion chart is also included at the bottom of the holder and shows the most common weights and measures used in cooking, reducing your need to use measuring cups and spoons. Experience the joy of cooking and follow recipes faithfully from beginning to end with the Prepara Chef’s Center Cookbook Holder .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Sq+jk3y1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prepara","source_asin":"B001334V80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001334V80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001334V80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
