window.products.push({"id":1044292,"name":"South Shore Flam Swivel Chair-Black, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":122.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31w5SiOJKeL._AC_.jpg","description":"The ideal chair for a functional office Whatever the purpose of your work space – you use it when working at home or your kid sits there to do homework – it should be adapted to your needs. And even if you have the best desk in the world, you won’t be able to use it to its full potential if you’ve paired it with a bad chair. Here’s a chair with 5 wheels, so you can slide from one end of your desk to the other to pick up materials and work more productively. Absolute comfort It’s certainly harder to focus if we spend our time twisting around trying to get comfortable. Fortunately, the fixed cushion and large chair back will give you excellent support, so you can work efficiently for hours. Modern and timeless Just because it’s a work space, that doesn’t mean your office has to look bland and boring. On the contrary, we need a little motivation because we spend so much time there This modern looking chair will add an original, elegant touch to any decor. It’s sure to be the center of attention in your office for years to come 1-year limited South Shore is proud to stand behind this office swivel chair with an exclusive 1-year limited . Shop with confidence knowing your purchase is always covered. All our products meets or exceeds North American safety standards and our packaging are tested and certified to reduce the risk of damage during shipment. This item is shipped in 1 box, make sure to have a friend with you. Assembly is required by 2 adults and tools are not included. If you have questions regarding this product or need assistance do not hesitate to contact South Shore Furniture 7 days support. You can reach customer support by phone at 1. 800. 290. 0465 or you may chat with an agent live at: southshorefurniture . This product is made in Chine for South Shore with polypropylene and Metal. Accessories not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31w5SiOJKeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B084CPKJDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084CPKJDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084CPKJDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
