window.products.push({"id":1044304,"name":"Whiskey Stones - Premium Chilling Rocks for Whiskey Scotch or Other Fine Drinks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PcHRwrB9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Whiskey Stones by Neatrox have been designed to help you enjoy your premium spirits as they were intended - cooled to the perfect sipping temperature and not watered down! If you’re looking for a gift (or something for yourself) that is classy and very unique, then definitely consider these whiskey stones chilling rocks. They are perfect for aficionados who enjoy their beverages with a slight chill, but prefer not to water down the ideal blend of flavors in their preferred spirit. Pull them right out of the freezer, pop them into your favorite glass and pour your treasured whiskey right over them for the perfect chill. ★ Set of 9 whiskey stones and 1 black velvet storage pouch for ease of storage and carry. ★ Simply wash then pop them in your freezer, and they'll be ready to use in just a couple of hours. ★ These whiskey stones have rounded edges so they will not scratch your drinking glasses, old-fashioned whiskey glasses, highball glasses, lowball glasses or glen cairn glasses. ★ Perfect cube shape of the stones also forms a solid surface area that allows for a better and more even chilling. ★ Whiskey stones are nonporous - they will not add any flavors or odors to your drinks. ★ Safe, natural material. These whiskey stones are made of soapstone. ★ BPA Free. ★ Each whiskey stone is roughly 3/4\" square. ★ Great alternative to ice cubes, ice ball maker molds and ice spheres. ★ Whiskey stones make the perfect fathers day gift, anniversary gift, birthday gift, groomsmen gift, gift for best man, and other drink aficionado. Forget using those old-fashioned ice cubes, BUY THESE WHISKEY STONES NOW and start to enjoy your drink properly, so your last sip ends as good as the first started!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PcHRwrB9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neatrox","source_asin":"B00U6ZJ91K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U6ZJ91K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U6ZJ91K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1044305,"name":"UltraBlock Ultra Plush Premium Waterproof Mattress Protector (Twin XL) – Breathable, Vinyl Free, Noiseless Mattress Cover, Fitted Style with Deep Pock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DoREoPkVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WATERPROOF - Sleep with peace of mind knowing your mattress pad is designed with water resistant fabric to be totally protected from spills and accidents. SAFE SLEEPING - No need to sneeze while you snooze with this waterproof mattress protector. Keep unwanted guests out and comfort in with this safe, thick yet breathable fabric. DEEP POCKETS - Don't spend savings on a topper that doesn't fit. No matter the size, the 18\" pockets on our twin XL mattress cover will have you covered. TOP TIER TECH - This waterproof mattress pad is designed with you in mind. The topper stays light and breathable, while the cotton terry/smooth plush top wicks away moisture. CUSTOMER SUPPORT - Any questions about our mattress covers? Our customer support team is happy to help you ease your worries and get the sleep you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DoREoPkVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UltraBlock","source_asin":"B0BN4QSBY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN4QSBY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN4QSBY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
