window.products.push({"id":1044334,"name":"Couristan Recife Veranda Indoor/Outdoor Area Rug Champagne/Taupe, 7'6\" x 10'9\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":136.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ax0KW3KaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1583/2312 Veranda Rug in Taupe. This rug features a floral scroll design. Great for use in transitional and traditional decors. Don't Be Fooled. Every outdoor rug is 100% polypropylene… on the surface.  Most outdoor rugs use Jute beneath the surface to hold their rugs together.  While this does allow for a faster, easier production, it is subject to dry rot, and discoloration of connecting fibers. Unlike our competition, Couristan employs a 100% polypropylene binding system to ensure a longer lasting, higher quality indoor/outdoor rug. At Home Anywhere. Houses, Apartments, RVs, Townhomes, seriously any home.  Indoor or outdoor, a rug is a simple and inexpensive way to make any space feel like a home. It adds warmth underfoot, while softening the feel of any area. They can be used in high traffic areas, near pools, on patios, decks, kitchens, laundry rooms, basements—the list is endless. Harsh Environments Demand Strict Testing. Couristan has been at the forefront of outdoor design and development since introducing the outdoor rug.  We believe that testing is our responsibility to you.   We set the standard by requiring that all our outdoor rugs pass 6 laboratory tests before earning the Couristan outdoor name. Kid and Pet Friendly. These rugs are both kid and pet safe.  The rug can be hosed and dried outside, making it great for high traffic areas and rooms that see heavy use.  Kids are no match for this rug.   For over 90-years, the Couristan brand has been revered as an icon of style and quality for its exquisite area rugs. The Recife Rug Collection is one of our top selling outdoor collections. Home to a multitude of styles and colors.  If you love the concept of this performance indoor/outdoor rug, but haven’t found your perfect design or color, don’t fret. We’ve got you covered with a multitude of designs to fit almost any home.  Our durability is unparalleled making this a great rug for high traffic areas, homes with pets, or just about anyone looking for great quality and value.  Explore its line up and experience its benefits today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ax0KW3KaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Couristan","source_asin":"B01M3YKJIA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3YKJIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3YKJIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
