window.products.push({"id":1044420,"name":"NOVICA Decoupage Wood Jewelry Box Chest of Drawers, Huichol Portal'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LtUx4kz2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: The sun, the shaman, and the peyote flower are all sacred symbols of Huichol cosmogony now on display on this jewelry box from Mexico. Ana Maria González masters decoupage techniques on a pinewood jewelry box featuring a top deck with three compartments and a lower drawer. 5.5\" H x 7\" W x 4.7\" DHand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightlyAbout our Artist: Mexico's Ana Maria Gonzalez says, 'For as long as I can remember, I've been around arts and crafts. My whole family produced something and when we'd visit our relatives, my cousins and I would make something for fun. After I married, my husband and I created various kinds of handicrafts, but I felt a need to make something. I began making decorative boxes, painted by hand with different finishes. Today I create boxes with antique motifs.'...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LtUx4kz2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01IFZJM50","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IFZJM50","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IFZJM50","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
