window.products.push({"id":1044464,"name":"Waring Drink Mixer, Quite White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KGvwRUqGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description PDM101 Color: Quite White Features: -Base material: Die cast metal. -Material: Stainless steel. -Single spindle operation. -Heavy duty 2 speed motor. Color: Product Type: -Frozen Drink Maker. Dimensions: Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -2.7 Inches. Overall Width - Side to Side: -22 Inches. Overall Depth - Front to Back: -1.3 Inches. Color Quite White - Overall Product Weight: -9.36 Pounds. Color Chili Red - Overall Product Weight: -9.36 Pounds. Color Retro Green - Overall Product Weight: -9.2 Pounds. Color Ebony - Overall Product Weight: -9.36 Pounds. Amazon.com I don't know why the term \"soda jerk\" stuck, because anyone who whips up luscious shakes is anything but. This nifty Waring drink mixer proves that point, and is really easy to operate. First, slide the 28-ounce stainless-steel mixing cup up under the agitator and secure the lip under the cup holder, resting the bottom on the cup rest. Then, slide the control switch to low or high and that's it. It's versatile, too, and makes shakes or pancake batter, as well as whirring eggs and milk together for a perfect omelet. Best of all, its heavy-duty 2-speed commercial motor whips a cup of cream in less than a minute. And, if you're feeling swank, it mixes up a Grasshopper or Brandy Alexander in a snap. --C. Whitney-Ward","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KGvwRUqGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waring","source_asin":"B00004T6JO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004T6JO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004T6JO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
