window.products.push({"id":1044536,"name":"1 Roll Privacy Window Film Frosted Window Film Anti-UV Static Cling Glass Film No Glue Window Film For Halloween's Office Bathroom Home Glass Door 17.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X81tLeNQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features of Frosted Window Film 1. Can be used at the Home, Office, Diningroom, Kitchen, Bedroom, Kindergarten 2. No glue, clean and bright, no hidden trouble. 3. 90% Anti-UV, reduce time of using air conditioner, low-carbon and energy conservation. 4. Easy to install, reuse and protect your window glass, no trace left. 5.You can remove as you need. Frosted Privacy Window Film Instructions: Step 1. Keep Window or Glass clean Step 2. Wet the Window or Glass with water (Soapy water will be the best choice) Step 3. Remove the Static Film from backing protect sheet Step 4. When you install it, Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Step 5. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Notice For Frosted Window Film: 1> If you want to remove it, simply peel the window film from any corner. It comes off cleanly without leaving residue 2> When not in use, the film must be replaced and stored on the original backing paper. The side of the film that touched the glass should face the glossy side of the backing paper 3> Our film does not apply to carved, over frosted or irregular glass Frosted Window Film Q&A: Q:How long will this film last for? A:In normal condition, it will last for 2 year on the window Q:Why there is bubbles inside? A:Because the water is not cleaned out entirly. After you position the film, please smooth out the film with squeegee, make the air bubbles and water out completely Q:Could this film be used for more than one times? A:Yes, but the stickup side of the film must be completely clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X81tLeNQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeTree","source_asin":"B01L3UZ0PU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L3UZ0PU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L3UZ0PU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
