window.products.push({"id":1044575,"name":"Electric Pepper and Salt Grinder Set, Gravity Pepper Grinder Battery Operated, Adjustable Coarseness Salt Shakers, Automatic Salt and Pepper Mills, On","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bVVEWIvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔲FITS YOUR BIG HAND FOR A PERFECT GRIP-We collected opinions from European and American customers and created this 8.1 in *2.1 in salt and pepper grinder. The pepper mill grinder is more ergonomic for European and American customers than other products on the market, it fits your big hand perfectly, ensuring you can hold it comfortably in your hand, easy to grip and turn without worrying about when you use it will fall 🔲PRESERVE THE MAXIMUM FLAVOR OF YOUR SPICES-Our peppercorn grinders has a one-piece body, and the back is designed with a transparent push-top compartment to protect your spices from moisture and dust. The refillable grinders can adjust the thickness to peel the spices layer by layer to release the maximum flavor. The adjustable coarseness grinders don't absorb taste or smell, enjoy your art of living with our taste tools 🔲GRAVITY AUTOMATIC & SUITABLE FOR THE ELDERLY-Our gravity pepper mill features an advanced gravity-sensing design that makes it easy to get fresh ground salt or pepper by simply inverting it. The convenient one handed operation are great for seniors with poor wrists or loved ones with arthritis or chronic hand pain. The peppercorn grinder is also a great solution for any cook looking for an almost effortless one-handed grind 🔲BATTERY POWERED & ANTI-MISTOUCH SWITCH-The electric pepper grinders are designed with high efficiency power supply, and the battery compartment is easy to install and remove. Each black pepper grinder requires 4 AAA batteries. (The product does not contain batteries) (All battery grinders on the market need to install 7 batteries) The one-button power switch design of the one hand automatic operation solves the work pain points after accidental touch 🔲MORE DETAILS MAKE GRINDERS A GIFTING CHOICE-Our kitchen pepper grinder is easy to refill, blue led light, adjustable thickness settings allow you to enjoy the food as you like, the multipurpose grinder is suitable for salt, pepper, and spices such as cumin, cloves, sea salt, etc. Take it to camping, picnics, Even BBQ night. The sleek and stylish salt pepper grinder set is the perfect gift for family and friends. We promise to provide after-sales guarantee and 24-hour online service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bVVEWIvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B09QGW7ZS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QGW7ZS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QGW7ZS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
