window.products.push({"id":1044614,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Villa Della Luna Anniversary Risotto P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oFdOMavIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Exclusive to Pfaltzgraff - To celebrate Villa della Luna's 10th anniversary, we designed 10 limited edition pieces, each with a special backstamp that reads, \"Ten Years & Still in Love - Happy Anniversary 2004 - 2014\". This unique dish is shaped to serve your favorite risotto, but perfect for a variety of dishes. The script references the \"Risotto of Welcomes and Beginnings\", expressing the spirit of hope and emotional renewal that is the essence of the Villa Della Luna. Crafted of stoneware, featuring a reactive glaze. Microwave and dishwasher safe. Anniversary risotto platter measures 17 inch long x 9-1/2 inch wide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oFdOMavIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B00HV215RM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HV215RM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HV215RM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1044615,"name":"HyeFlora Boutique Artificial Flowers Cherry Blossom Simulation, Faux Silk Plum Flower Branches Bundles for Home Table Decoration Centerpiece, Tall Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ENEQLZn6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the Authentic Look of Real Cherry Blossoms: Our artificial cherry blossom flowers are a stunning addition to any room or outdoor area, with lifelike colors that perfectly imitate the natural beauty of real cherry blossoms. Each petal features multiple layers and is manually curled for a delicate and elegant appearance. Symbolic of spring and new beginnings, these cherry blossoms can brighten up any space and bring a fresh touch of nature into your home or workplace. Customize Your Display with Flexible Stems: With our cherry blossoms, you have the flexibility to create a unique and personalized display. The stems are made with a sturdy yet pliable plastic material that can be easily shaped to your liking, while the leaves and petals can be detached to achieve the perfect length and arrangement. Each box contains three branches that measure 36 inches each, making them perfect for larger vases or floor displays. Whether you prefer a simple and elegant arrangement or something more elaborate, these cherry blossoms can be customized to fit your unique vision. Premium Materials for a Realistic Feel: Our cherry blossoms are made with premium silk material that looks and feels just like real flowers. The petals are soft and delicate, while the leaves and stems are sturdy and realistic-looking. The high-quality plastic stems are strong and durable, allowing you to create a lasting and beautiful display that will stay looking fresh and vibrant for years to come. Available in pink, hot pink, and white, these cherry blossoms are the perfect addition to any indoor or outdoor arrangement. Versatile Decoration for Any Occasion: Whether you're hosting a special event like a wedding, anniversary, or birthday party, or simply want to add a touch of natural beauty to your home or office, our cherry blossoms are the perfect choice. They're versatile enough to be used in a wide range of settings, from living rooms and bedrooms to kitchen islands and bathroom vanities. They can also be used to brighten up outdoor areas like balconies and gardens, adding a touch of natural beauty to your outdoor space. Satisfaction Guaranteed or Your Money Back: At HyeFlora, we stand behind the quality of our products and want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase. If for any reason you're not happy with your artificial cherry blossom flowers, simply reach out to our sales team and we'll be happy to assist you. Whether you need a refund or a replacement, we're here to make sure you're completely satisfied with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ENEQLZn6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HyeFlora","source_asin":"B0B92YB93Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B92YB93Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B92YB93Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
