window.products.push({"id":1044639,"name":"Duvet Cover Set King Size, Aqua Blue Seersucker Textured Duvet Cover Set with Zipper Closure & Corner Ties, 3 Pieces (1 Duvet Cover 2 Pillowcases) 100","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718C3NXKazS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【Unique Seersucker Design】Our stripe aqua blue seersucker textured duvet cover is made of washed seersucker which is woven in such a way that some threads bunch together, giving the fabric a wrinkled appearance in places. Compared to the other same solid color products, the seemingly irregular folds are embellished with the unique individuality and artistic sense of the duvet cover, which brings an elegant and chic style atmosphere to your bedroom and guest room 💦【Durable Washed Microfiber】The plain side of this textured seersucker duvet cover is made of 100% thickened washed microfiber material which has ultra cozy touch. The washed cloth is specially treated to make the surface of the fabric and touch softer and skin-friendly, and the slight wrinkle reflects the sense of old feeling. The microfiber seersucker duvet cover is softer and breathable, creating a relaxing and comfortable sleeping environment, making it easier for the body to fall asleep 💦【Friendly Zipper and Corner Ties Design】Our seersucker comforter cover features zipper closure design, it can save your precious time to changing your luxury comforter and duvet and more convenient than regular button closure. At the same time, our duvet covers have four inner corner ties which can keep our duvet or comforter in the right place without slipping around all night long 💦【Dimension & Package】►Twin Size: 1 duvet cover (68\"x 90\"), 2 pillow cases (20\"x 26\"). ►Queen Size: 1 duvet cover (90\"x 90\"), 2 pillow cases (20\"x 26\"). ►King Size: 1 duvet cover (104\"x 90\"), 2 pillow cases (20\"x 36\") . Note: NOT INCLUDE COMFORTER AND PILLOW 💦【Easy Care & Customer Services】The aqua blue seersucker duvet cover is machine washable. Please wash separately before first use, turning it inside-out, machine wash with cold water cycle, gentle and low temperature drying. Avoid hang dry which will cause deformation. Do not bleach or dry clean. The seersucker itself is wrinkled, so it doesn't need to be ironed after washing, and the care is simple and does not take too much time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718C3NXKazS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHOSHOME","source_asin":"B08BRB89D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BRB89D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BRB89D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
