window.products.push({"id":1044711,"name":"Crystal Whiskey Decanters, Lead-free Decanter with Glass Stopper, Vodka decanter for Wine, Bourbon, Brandy, Liquor, Juice, Water, Mouthwash(Priest)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oFj15aMZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUPER CAPACITY FOR GLASS DECANTER】: 3.15''(W) x 12''(H) ;670ML/ 22.65oz. This whiskey decanter can enhance your drinking experience. Frosted mouth is adopted in the contact part of the bottle mouth and the plug to guarantee good sealing. 【SAFE MATERIAL】: Our exquisite liquor decanter bottles and stoppers are made of thick and luminous lead-free crystal glass, a non-toxic and durable material that can be safely used in all kinds of whiskey bottles production. These bourbon decanters are able to make the liquid maintain a delightfully refreshing taste. And this alcohol decanter, with a weighted base, can stand firmly on tables and other surfaces. 【DECANTERS FOR ALCOHOL】: Our whisky decanter comes with a glass stopper for easy grasping and removal. The high-quality glass can prevent the liquid from evaporating and avoid excessive oxygen intake to guarantee fresh and mellow taste. The decanters are uniquely shaped with elegance and refinement, so people can always be impressed by the brilliant design and the fine durability. And we will use thick packaging to ensure no damage in decanters’ transit. 【GLASS BOTTLES FOR LIQUOR】: This is the perfect decanter for wine, whiskey, brandy, Scotch bourbon, tequila, vodka and etc. Fresh juice, water, mouthwash and other liquid can be stored in this decanter. Working as a vase is also fine. 【PERFECT GIFT】: Our whiskey decanters are the perfect gifts for birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas, Father’s Day and other holidays. These crystal whiskey decanters can also be nice presents for your family or friends on weddings, housewarming, parties or other important occasions. If you have any question about our decanters, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oFj15aMZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uEmoh","source_asin":"B09JSR4QSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JSR4QSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JSR4QSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
