window.products.push({"id":1044975,"name":"FrancisFrancis! X5 Espresso Machine, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FN7S5798L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Named after the sleek, invisible-to-radar airplane, the X-5 Espresso Machine from FrancisFrancis! meets the needs of small-kitchen owners with big coffee tastes. While the body of the X5 has been reduced to the minimum, its high-quality construction—including a brass broiler for thermal stability, a chrome-plated brass brewing head and a commercial-diameter brewing handle—ensures stupendous coffee. Use either the Easy Serving Espresso system (ESE)—pre-ground, single servings of espresso coffee packed in filter paper—or the Supercrema system for pre-ground coffee. A steamer arm froths milk for cappuccinos, and an easy-to-regulate, elegant clock gives the exact time. With a joie-de-vivre nod to both beauty and function, FrancisFrancis! takes the average out of the everyday. Made in Italy. 10-3/8Lx8-3/4Wx11-1/4H. Amazon.com FrancisFrancis! espresso machines aren't just a design dream aesthetically. They're also engineered to do much of the barista work for you, removing intimidation and trial-by-fire from the home espresso game. This fabulous-looking all-metal X5 model features a brass boiler and the Supercrema brewing system, pump-driven with 8-9 bars of dynamic pressure. The chrome-plated brass brewing handle maintains ideal temperatures for coffee, while the steam/hot water wand swivels for tidy storage. One of the friendliest aspects of the X5 is its ability to brew espresso with either pre-measured ESE (Easy Serving Espresso) coffee pods or with loose grounds from your favorite bean vendor. Two interchangeable handle baskets are included, one for each method. Three filters also come with the machine for pulling ristretto, regular, or lungo shots. Measuring 10-1/4 by 8-1/4 by 11-1/4 inches, the X5 is a relatively compact machine, built with flat sides to save space on tight countertops. Keep in mind that it weighs 16 pounds, so you'll want to make a permanent spot for it, and that the 48-ounce water tank is accessed from the back, so you'll need room to work behind it. The sleek little battery-powered clock on the front of the machine pops out for setting and battery replacement. FrancisFrancis! includes a detailed instruction and tip guide, as well as a starter container of Illy Café espresso. --Emily Bedard From the Manufacturer Obviously the X-Stealth, or X5, isnt really anti-radar, and, even if it was it wouldnt be of much use. Its called the X-Stealth because its angular, sloping form resembles that of the airplanes and ships invisible to radar. Its a machine for the small kitchen because its body has been reduced to the minimum. It makes stupendous coffee both with the Easy Serving Espresso (ESE) system and with ground coffee, thanks to the SUPERCREAM system. A beautifully centered clock gives the exact time and is easily regulated. With the side handle, vapor and hot water are produced. Features: Pump driven with 8-9 bars of dynamic pressure Pump driven with 8-9 bars of dynamic pressure Water tank holds 48 ounces of water Water tank holds 48 ounces of water Chrome plated brass brewing handle maintains ideal temperature of coffee Chrome plated brass brewing handle maintains ideal temperature of coffee Both ESE pod and ground coffee handle included Dimensions: 8-1/4 inches W by 10-1/4 inches D by 11-1/4 inches H. Weight: 16 pounds. Both ESE pod and ground coffee handle included Dimensions: 8-1/4 inches W by 10-1/4 inches D by 11-1/4 inches H. Weight: 16 pounds. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FN7S5798L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Francis!Francis!","source_asin":"B0000AFX4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000AFX4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000AFX4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1044976,"name":"Deco 79 Metal Geometric Cut-Out Single Panel Fireplace Screen with Mesh Netting, 40\" x 6\" x 32\", Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pbbf88r7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep those straw ambers at bay with this fire place screen. Adding style even when the fire isn't lit, this fireplace screen adds style as well as function. Offers a great style to your living room or home office while giving the protection from burning coal.. This item ships in 1 carton. Please note that this item is for decorative use only. This fireplace screen features paint that can resist heat up to 600 degrees.. Suitable for indoor use only. This fire screen has one main screen panel. This is a single fireplace screen. Contemporary style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pbbf88r7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B09F8HZ3KH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F8HZ3KH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F8HZ3KH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1044977,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies Classics Somebunny Special Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ICBmmQfnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"For over 27 years Department 56 artist, Kristi Jensen Pierro has captured the beauty and splendor of winter. Her personal experiences and interpretations of childhood are artfully designed into each Snowbabies' piece and carefully named to ensure a sentiment of love, friendship or inspiration. The new SnowDream collection is inspired by a winter walk in the woods with icy colors of white, pink, grey and cool taupe. Each piece is sprinkled with glitter creating a magical effect. \"As an artist my job is to invent. After a year of sketching and conceptualizing I created this new collection. It's a nostalgic collection of figural giftware and trim full of warmth, whimsy and magic. It combines the simple elegance of bisque porcelain with glitter, shiny mica and tinsel. I love the results and I hope that collectors will, too!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ICBmmQfnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00CXN8C3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CXN8C3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CXN8C3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
