window.products.push({"id":1044993,"name":"Dinosaur Toys for Kids 3-5, 24Pcs Dinosaur World Surprise Toys Set with Different Dino Figure, Birthday Gifts Easter Basket Stuffers for Boys Girls To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P0mDhktNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【24Pcs Dinosaur Toys】: There are no days more anticipated than Birthday month, right? If you have a kid who's into dinosaurs, you know there's nothing better than the idea of getting a new dinosaur every day. Our dinosaur toys gifts do it well, designed with 24 numbers to hide many kinds of dinosaurs. Children are able to look forward to birthdays with a new surprise for each day. 🦖【Create A Jurassic World】: Your child is fascinated by dinosaurs? Don't miss these dinosaur toys, it includes 24 adorable prehistoric friends, like Spinosaurus, Velociraptor, Tyrannosaurus, Triceratops, and more, to surprise your kids on each day of the countdown! they are also durable and can give your boys and girls endless hours of imaginative play both indoors and outdoors, little ones can create their own Jurassic World anywhere! 🔎【Learning while playing】: “Dinosaurs and dinosaur toys are the gateways to science for so many children,” Ashley Hall, outreach program manager at the Museum of the Rockies, tells Verywell Family. So, this dinosaur gifts set is a great educational toy for your kids, they are suitable for creative play and can spark your children’s curiosity, each dinosaur has realistic features and is made of high-quality materials, helping them learn about these creatures that existed on this planet millions of years ago. 👍【Non-Toxic & BPA -free】: For the choice of kids' toys, there is no more important than safety. These dinosaur toys are made of high-quality PVC, 100% non-toxic and BPA-free, more durable, and safe. The bright and eye-catching design will also attract children's attention more and make play longer. 🎁【Perfect Gifts for Kids】: If you are looking for wonderful Newyear gifts for your little tot, then this kid's toys set is your first choice. This cool set of 24 dinosaurs can satisfy their fascination for dinosaurs in their minds of them, they are randomly wrapped in a paper hole to keep every figure leading up to Christmas a surprise! It's the ideal birthday gift for kids toddlers boys girls, ages 3 years and up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P0mDhktNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gruntbear","source_asin":"B0B6PLQY17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1044993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6PLQY17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6PLQY17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
